# AGENTS.md - Workspace Instructions

This is the single workspace instruction file loaded by the EFP native runtime.

## Operating Rules

- Work inside the configured workspace unless the user asks otherwise.
- Inspect relevant files before editing.
- Preserve user changes and avoid unrelated refactors.
- Keep edits focused on the request and the surrounding code ownership.
- Prefer `rg` for file and text search.
- Run targeted tests or checks when behavior changes.
- Explain blockers with the concrete command or condition that failed.

## Tool Use

- Use the EFP built-in tools available in the runtime.
- Treat destructive filesystem operations as high risk.
- Keep command output concise when reporting back to the user.

## Project Notes

- Keep durable project guidance in this file.
- Use clearly named project documents for task-specific notes when useful.
